  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1186678/description_985dc419-3614-4a5b-b3c3-3c90405e38b8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"300\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>关于整合包</strong></span></p>\n<p>本整合包将《JOJO的奇妙冒险》加入游戏中，融合了冒险/RPG元素，为您带来一场真正的“奇妙冒险”。核心JOJO模组基于JCraft: Eyes of Ender，允许您召唤自己的替身来对抗世界的危险。这里有巨龙、地下城、Boss，甚至还有自带替身的生物！建议与好友一同游玩，使用白金之星、世界、绯红之王、杀手皇后、黄金体验等独特替身展开对决！您甚至可以使用替身碟片收集各个替身，并学习它们独有的连招技能！如果想了解每个替身的详细能力，请务必查看JCraft: Eyes of Enders模组。&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>我与朋友联机游玩所使用的服务器托管服务（使用优惠码 SNO 首月立减 20%）：</strong><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwepwawet.net%252fp%252fsno\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wepwawet.net/p/sno</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>我的视频</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vftaKfv-aNY\" width=\"1264\" height=\"711\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>包含的模组</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks (由 P3pp3rF1y 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/natures-compass\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Compass (由 Chaosyr 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/towns-and-towers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Towns and Towers (由 Biban_Auriu 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib (由 Gecko 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lootr\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lootr (Forge &amp; NeoForge) (由 Noobanidus 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cristel-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cristel Lib (由 Cristelknight 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" rel=\"nofollow\">playerAnimator (由 KosmX 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lionfish-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lionfish API (由 mcl_ender 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oculus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oculus (由 Asek3 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap (由 xaero96 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artifacts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Artifacts (由 ochotonida 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-third-person\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Third Person (由 Socolio 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corgilib\" rel=\"nofollow\">CorgiLib (由 Corgi_Taco 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender 's Cataclysm (由 mcl_ender 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\">MmmMmmMmmMmm (Target Dummy) (由 MehVahdJukaar 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones (由 BlayTheNinth 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/medieval-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Medieval Buildings - New Structures! (由 Lupin 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-strongholds\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Strongholds (Forge) (由 YUNGNICKYOUNG 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cosmetic Armor Reworked (由 LainMI 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/projectile-damage-attribute\" rel=\"nofollow\">Projectile Damage Attribute [Fabric &amp; Forge] (由 daedelus_dev 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes We've Gone (由 AOCAWOL 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios API (Forge/NeoForge) (由 TheIllusiveC4 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cataclysm-apotheosis-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cataclysm Apotheosis Addon (由 kurokogedesu 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jcraft-eyes-of-ender\" rel=\"nofollow\">JCraft: Eyes of Ender (JoJo) (由 Arna 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambientsounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">AmbientSounds 6 (由 CreativeMD 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mowzies-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mowzie's Mobs (由 bobmowzie 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corpse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Corpse (由 henkelmax 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pehkui\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pehkui (由 Virtuoel 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-end-island\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better End Island (Forge) (由 YUNGNICKYOUNG 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API (Fabric/Forge/NeoForge) (由 shedaniel 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/medieval-buildings-end-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Medieval Buildings [End Edition] (由 Lupin 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli (由 Vazkii 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polymorph\" rel=\"nofollow\">Polymorph (Fabric/Forge/Quilt) (由 TheIllusiveC4 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/embeddium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Embeddium (由 FiniteReality 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativeCore (由 CreativeMD 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Fire: Dragons (由 sbom_xela 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selene\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moonlight Lib (由 MehVahdJukaar 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender (Forge) (由 TheAdubbz 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-trees-youll-grow\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Trees You'll Grow (由 Corgi_Taco 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endremastered\" rel=\"nofollow\">End Remastered [NeoForge/Fabric] (由 jack_bagel 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty (由 Forstride 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise - Forge! (由 Aureljz 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chunky-pregenerator-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chunky (Forge/NeoForge) (由 pop4959 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API (由 shedaniel 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/attributizer\" rel=\"nofollow\">Attributizer (由 TheRealJackiecrazy 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI) (由 mezz 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's API (Forge) (由 YUNGNICKYOUNG 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apotheosis (由 Shadows_of_Fire 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/attributefix\" rel=\"nofollow\">AttributeFix (由 DarkhaxDev 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Core (由 P3pp3rF1y 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythic-mounts-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Mounts (Forge) (由 chirpycricket__ 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/balm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Balm (由 BlayTheNinth 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/citadel\" rel=\"nofollow\">Citadel (由 sbom_xela 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/azurelib\" rel=\"nofollow\">AzureLib (由 AzureDoomC 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mariums-soulslike-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Marium's Soulslike Weaponry (由 mariumbacchus 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/placebo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Placebo (由 Shadows_of_Fire 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest (由 Benimatic 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-attributes\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apothic Attributes (AttributesLib) (由 Shadows_of_Fire 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tickrate-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tickrate API (由 min01 制作)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise-seven-seas\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise - Seven Seas (由 Aureljz 制作)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
